# 验证：grant everything 之后，到底有几个进度是"完成"的。
#
# 机制：进度完成时会解锁它奖励里的配方；解锁配方触发
# minecraft:recipe_unlocked，于是拥有那个配方的进度的 has_the_recipe
# 自动完成 —— 如果命令还没走到它，它就被跳过、不计数。
#
# 关键数字：
#   - 第一次 grant everything 的计数
#   - 第二次 grant everything 的计数（= 488 - 完成后进度的个数）
#   - 第二次 grant 里，has_the_recipe 完成但另一个条件没完成的进度，
#     到底算不算"完成"
#
# 期望：第一次 481；第二次 = 488 - 完成的个数

--- console ---
say M01
advancement grant Steve everything
say M02
advancement grant Steve everything
say M03
advancement grant Steve everything
say M04
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/coal
say M05
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/diamond
say M06
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/emerald
say M07
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_ingot_from_block
say M08
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_ingot_from_block
say M09
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/lapis_lazuli
say M10
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/slime_ball
say M11
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/redstone/redstone
say M12
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/bone_meal_from_block
say M13
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/wheat
say M14
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_nugget
say M15
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_nugget
say M16

